{"id":"word:hebrew:H3050","type":"word","title":"יָהּ","subtitle":"H3050 • Hebrew word","simple":{"meaning":"Jah , the sacred name","inThisVerse":"The selected word is tied to יָהּ (H3050) in the Hebrew source text. Part of speech: n-pr.","whyItMatters":"This word appears 50 times in the Hebrew Bible, so BibleIQ can compare how Scripture uses it across multiple passages.","summary":"יָהּ (Yâhh) means Jah , the sacred name First listed occurrence: Exod 15 2."},"evidence":{"originalLanguage":{"source":"hebrew","word":"יָהּ","transliteration":"Yâhh","pronunciation":"yaw","strong":"H3050","lemmaId":"hebrew:H3050","partOfSpeech":"n-pr","forms":["יָֽהּ","יָ֨הּ","יָ֑הּ","יָּ֑הּ","יָ֔הּ"],"morphs":[["HNp",48],["HR/Np",2]]},"definitions":{"short":"Jah , the sacred name","usage":"Jah, the Lord, most vehement. Compare names in '-iah,' '-jah.'","full":"H3050. Yah יָהּ 50 proper name, of deity contracted from יהוה , first appears in early poems; Exod 15:2 יָהּ וְזִמְרָת עָזִי My strength and song is Yah (cited Isa 12:2 ; Psa 118:14 ), compare the poetic extract יָהּ כֵּס עַל יָד = hand to the throne of Yah Exod 17:16 (E), the song of Hezekiah Isa 38:11 (repeated by dittography), יה להבת (א)שׁ (so read in preference to the שַׁלְהֶבֶתְיָה ᵑ0 ) = flame of fire from Yah Song 8:6 ; יהוה ביה Isa 26:4 ( והיה sustained by Aq and the rhythmical movement, unless it be a mistake for שׁמו , compare Psa 68:5 ), אלהים יה 68:19 . Elsewhere יָהּ is used only in late Psalms, especially in the Hallels, in the phrase הַלֲלוּיָֿהּ praise ye Yah 104:35 ; 105:45 ; 106:1 ; 106:48 ; 111:1 ; 112:1 ; 113:1 ; 113:9 ; 115:18 ; 116:19 ; 117:2 ; 135:1 ; 135:3 ; 135:21 ; 146:1 ; 146:10 ; 147:1 ; 147:20 ; 148:1 ; 148:14 ; 149:1 ; 149:9 ; 150:1 ; 150:6 , compare also יה יהלל 102:19 יה יהללו 115:17 יה תהלל 150:6 (see הלל ); in variant reading other phrases 77:12 ; 89:9 ; 94:7 ; 94:12 ; 115:18 ; 118:5 (twice in verse); 118:17 ; 118:18 ; 118:19 ; 122:4 ; 130:3 ; 135:4 . יָהּ proper name, of deity , see below הוה","rootNote":"contraction for 3068 , and meaning the same;","sources":["MorphHB occurrences","Strong Hebrew Dictionary","Brown-Driver-Briggs"]},"firstMention":"Exod 15 2","keyReferences":["Exod 15 2","Exod 17 16","Isa 12 2","Isa 26 4","Isa 38 11","Isa 38 11","Ps 68 5","Ps 68 19"],"related":{"people":[],"places":[],"concepts":[],"events":[]},"occurrenceCount":50,"occurrences":[{"reference":"Exod 15 2","book":"Exod","chapter":15,"verse":2,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"יָ֔הּ","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNp"},{"reference":"Exod 17 16","book":"Exod","chapter":17,"verse":16,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"יָ֔הּ","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNp"},{"reference":"Isa 12 2","book":"Isa","chapter":12,"verse":2,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"יָ֣הּ","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNp"},{"reference":"Isa 26 4","book":"Isa","chapter":26,"verse":4,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"בְּ/יָ֣הּ","source":"hebrew","morph":"HR/Np"},{"reference":"Isa 38 11","book":"Isa","chapter":38,"verse":11,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"יָ֔הּ","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNp"},{"reference":"Isa 38 11","book":"Isa","chapter":38,"verse":11,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"יָ֖הּ","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNp"},{"reference":"Ps 68 5","book":"Ps","chapter":68,"verse":5,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"בְּ/יָ֥הּ","source":"hebrew","morph":"HR/Np"},{"reference":"Ps 68 19","book":"Ps","chapter":68,"verse":19,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"יָ֬הּ","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNp"},{"reference":"Ps 77 12","book":"Ps","chapter":77,"verse":12,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"יָ֑הּ","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNp"},{"reference":"Ps 89 9","book":"Ps","chapter":89,"verse":9,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"יָ֑הּ","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNp"},{"reference":"Ps 94 7","book":"Ps","chapter":94,"verse":7,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"יָּ֑הּ","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNp"},{"reference":"Ps 94 12","book":"Ps","chapter":94,"verse":12,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"יָּ֑הּ","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNp"},{"reference":"Ps 102 19","book":"Ps"